%% Memory ranking & injection flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Atlas
    participant G as Grisha
    participant M as SQLite (better-sqlite3)
    participant R as Summarizer (summarizeRanked)
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant T as Token Metrics

    Note over O: Request arrives
    O->>M: recall recent entries (Atlas, Grisha)
    O->>R: summarizeRanked(entries, half_life, max_tokens)
    R-->>O: ranked context block
    O->>T: estimate tokens(len/4)
    T-->>O: token count
    O->>A: prompt + ranked context
    A-->>O: plan / output
    O->>M: rememberSafe(key facts)
    O->>T: increment memory_context_injections
    O->>T: add memory_context_tokens
    O->>G: validation with same or trimmed context
    G-->>O: verdict
    O-->>O: metrics pipeline_phase_* updated
